","path":"style.css"},{"content":"# Cloud Cargo

Cloud Cargo is an original deterministic cargo-allocation practice puzzle. Select a cargo crate, then assign it to an airship bay. Every bay must receive its exact mass total; manifests two and three also require exact energy totals. Three dispatched airships complete the expedition.

## Controls

- **Keyboard:** Left/Right chooses a crate or bay; Space selects or assigns.
- **Touch/mouse:** tap a crate and then tap a bay.
- Use Pause/Resume at any time and Play Again after a result.

Boards are generated deterministically from the session seed with a guaranteed hidden valid allocation. Restarting repeats that seed for mastery. The core simulation is DOM-free and advances in fixed 1/60-second ticks.
